&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;GitHub repository:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href="https://github.com/tk1981215/ai-nature-explorer" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://github.com/tk1981215/ai-nature-explorer&lt;/a&gt;
